                "title": "High Roller",
                "description": "Hey! This will definitely interest you! A mega-cool party at Kristall! Only the best of the best are invited. Here, take a flyer!<br><br><font color='#ffff00'>Take part in the Big Score event — collect Chips, play mini-games, progress through the event track. Until %s</font>",
